    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "kikcu3n",
      "content": "Chhattisgarh has developed irrigation infrastructure through canals, tanks, tube wells, and lift irrigation schemes. The state government has been investing in expanding irrigation facilities to reduce dependence on rainfall and increase agricultural productivity."
